going on with the airplane.

1255
00:45:52,980 --> 00:45:55,150
So again, the
leading edge slats,

1256
00:45:55,150 --> 00:45:57,660
there's no input from the pilot
other than just maneuvering.

1257
00:45:57,660 --> 00:45:59,670
They'll deploy
wherever they need to.

1258
00:45:59,670 --> 00:46:01,260
You'll see the
horizontal stabilators

1259
00:46:01,260 --> 00:46:02,340
And if you're close,
you can actually

1260
00:46:02,340 --> 00:46:04,007
