So this is from
another good buddy

1451
00:53:45,357 --> 00:53:47,190
of mine, a guy
name Zeke Skalicky,

1452
00:53:47,190 --> 00:53:48,550
who was the Raptor demo pilot.

1453
00:53:48,550 --> 00:53:49,893
Outstanding guy.

1454
00:53:49,893 --> 00:53:52,060
But this is the Raptor demo
if you've never seen it.

1455
00:53:52,060 --> 00:53:54,102
So we'll take some questions
